      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A 58-year-old male presented with an anterior mediastinal mass which was found to be secondary to an aneurysmal dilatation of the saphenous vein graft to his circumflex artery. This represents an unusual presentation of an aneurysmally dilated saphenous vein graft."},
